WEBVTT

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.780
I got one!

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.100
What is that?

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:03.240
I shall grant you a wish.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:01.720
Three of a kind.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.010
Sorry, but it looks like I take this hand.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:09.100
Lady Luck's a pal of mine, ya know.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.060
Well, I guess I'll be taking these...

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:16.060
A full house!

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:20.240
Sorry, but Lady Luck's my best friend!

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:22.610
Well, I guess I'll be taking these...

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.930
You're pretty good, aren't you?

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.510
Okay, fine, I'll play another hand with you.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:32.010
Come on, no more cards.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:35.540
More importantly, you now owe
me ten ice cream cones, you know.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:36.810
I want you to buy them now!

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:41.640
You'll make yourself sick if you eat
all ten at once. Make it one a month.

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:43.010
What are you talking about?!

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:45.390
You don't even have enough
money to buy ice cream cones?!

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:52.440
Um... Is this is Devil May Cry, the place
that "gets the job done whatever it may be"?

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:57.390
Yeah, that's right. But that only
applies when I'm in the mood.

00:03:57.390 --> 00:03:59.990
And today I'm in a lousy mood... So get lost.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.590
What are you saying?!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:05.020
You better buck up, get to work
and earn some ice cream money!

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:08.480
Welcome! Please come in!
I'll make you some tea!

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:14.720
I see... So you want me to
rescue your older brother,

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.030
who was arrested on false charges, correct?

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:18.730
Yes.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.550
What's the charge?

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:25.730
It's murder...

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:29.140
But there's no way my older brother
would have done something like that!

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:32.890
To begin with, the man who died,
Claude, was my brother's best friend!

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:34.560
I wonder...

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.900
Sometimes the better the
friends, the deeper the hatred...

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:40.590
That's not true! My brother
is the last person who would--

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.200
You have any proof?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.430
--I...
--Go home.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:51.040
It's like the stupid mother saying,
"My child would never do that!"

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:54.160
There's nothing less
trustworthy than feelings like that.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:58.370
To begin with, do you even
have money? I don't come cheap.

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:01.140
Ten ice cream cones should
about cover things...

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:05.570
I'll give you this as payment.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.640
It's pretty!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.940
No thanks. I only work for cash.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:15.770
What's she think she's doing?

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:19.690
Well, I guess we've accepted her payment...

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.160
Hey! Anyone here?

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:32.710
Yep.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.280
One strawberry sundae.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.510
We don't have treats for the kiddies here.

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:41.350
I didn't think you would... I can
never get 'em at places like this.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:44.810
But man, business is slow, huh?

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:45.680
Yeah...

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:50.800
I just haven't had any
customers since that incident.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.850
What a nuisance...

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:55.930
Tell me everything you
know about that incident.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:59.100
Who are you? A detective?

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:00.980
It doesn't matter either way.

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:02.760
You tell me that story,
and I'll tell you a secret

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:05.090
that'll have customers lined up out the door.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.740
I still can't believe it.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:11.950
Kerry and Claude were best friends...

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:21.230
Well, it seems Kerry was
on a losing streak...

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.370
All of a sudden I heard
this really loud scream.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.580
It's my...

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:39.060
It's my fault...

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.320
"It's my fault."

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:45.570
That's what this "Kerry" guy said?

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.850
Yeah. That was taken as a
confession and he was arrested.

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:50.680
There were no other
customers here, after all.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.830
And Claude's whole body
was just melted away...

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.300
You'd have thought it was
the work of the devil.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:02.050
So where is this Kerry guy now?

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:06.000
I hear he's locked up at Devil's Prison.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.730
--Morrison?
--I heard.

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:14.530
You're not actually thinking about
going to Devil's Prison, are you?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.230
What if I am?

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:17.790
Here's some friendly advice.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:20.030
Just forget about it.

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:24.890
There's a rumor that no one's ever
gone in there and come out alive.

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:26.770
It's supposedly worse than hell.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:30.730
I doubt even you could make it out of there.

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:33.580
Wanna bet?

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:35.680
Why the hell would I do that?

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:39.060
It's not like I'd get any
money from you even if I won.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:45.920
Hey! How about that secret that'll
have customers lined up out the door?

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:53.000
Just put strawberry sundaes on the menu.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.320
--Are you serious?
--Then that bastard...

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:06.820
You bastard!

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.740
What d'you think you're doing?!

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:10.060
Just taking out the trash.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.340
Gotta keep the town clean, ya know.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.500
Don't you dare mess with us!

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:33.890
This is a really nice place you got here...

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:37.820
A person could probably take a good
nap here, and not be bugged by anyone.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.150
It'll be a long nap all right.

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:41.920
You'll probably get to
nap for the rest of your life.

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:48.440
You know a guy named
Kerry Márquez? He's a pal of mine.

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:51.860
That guy's in a special cell block
for committers of heinous crimes.

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:54.020
A special cell, eh?

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:56.060
They must serve great food there, I bet...

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:58.130
You'll just be in a normal
cell for having committed

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.990
property damage and
infliction of personal injury.

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:01.280
Don't worry, though.

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.750
No matter what kind of cell you're in,
Devil's Prison is Devil's Prison.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:12.850
You must be a real bad apple
if you're carrying all this stuff.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.410
Oh, those are just accessories.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:18.030
I just made a little
mistake in regards to their size.

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:22.480
Well, don't you look cute and talk cute...

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:25.720
And this firm body of
yours looks so delicious...

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:30.610
You be a good boy and do like I tell
you, and I won't do anything mean to you.

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:38.570
You're the one who looks delicious...

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.580
Being all marbled with fat and all...

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:48.920
A special cell!
Throw him in a high security cell!

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:07.450
Hey.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:11.520
There should be some guy in here
by the name of "Kerry Márquez."

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:13.060
You know him?

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.100
Who are you?

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:26.910
Kerry...

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:45.570
I'm here 'cause someone out
there believes you're innocent.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:52.160
It's useless. Both of us will be killed soon.

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.240
Oh?

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:55.860
Well, why don't you just
give me the real story

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:59.000
so I have something to think
about on my way to the other side.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:03.510
I've told this story so many
times, but no one will believe me!

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:05.900
Who can blame them?!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.400
Like anyone's gonna believe
that a devil was responsible...

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:09.870
A devil?

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:13.240
Yeah... I didn't even believe it.

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.030
That something like that was even possible...

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:28.230
I shall grant you a wish.

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:34.800
What is the problem? I said I will
grant you a wish. Tell me what you want.

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:49.770
You don't have a wish?

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:54.590
Any wish will do. This
is a rare chance for you.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:02.420
Y-You'll... really... grant my wish?

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.610
Yes. Tell me now.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:08.880
Okay, give me money! I want to
be the richest man in the world!

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:11.070
No way.

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:15.820
Okay, give me power! I want to be
the most powerful man in the world!

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:19.310
No. It wouldn't benefit you.

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:22.940
Okay, I want women! I want all
the women in the world to be mine!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:25.420
No. I'm not interested.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:34.160
Heh, I guess there are some pretty
smart-ass devils out there, huh?

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:38.210
So? In the end, what was
the wish he granted you?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.780
Yeah... Well, he certainly granted my wish...

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:42.790
I wished for...

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.780
Sorry, looks like I win again.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.140
Let's play one more!

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:53.710
Hey, give it a rest. I got
to be getting to work soon.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:56.110
Sure, just up and run after your win!

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:57.230
Drop dead, you jerk!

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:03.010
I shall grant your wish.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:03.940
Huh?

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:11.660
Your wish has been granted.

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.800
No! Wh-What the hell have I...

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:20.980
What's going on?

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:23.510
What happened to him?!

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.700
It's my... It's my fault...

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:29.470
I killed him... I...

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:34.510
Of course I wasn't
serious when I told him to die!

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:39.190
But that bastard... he killed my friend!

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:43.590
I understand what you're saying,
and I believe your story.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.940
The only thing left to do
is get out of this place.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:50.010
Well, I wonder how we'll do that...

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:54.380
I'm telling you, it's impossible!
This place is worse than hell!

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:08.370
It's started again!

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:12.720
Attention all prisoners.
It's time for a little game of tag.

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:14.980
If you don't want to die, I suggest you run!

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:17.420
Run! Run!

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:19.400
What's this all about?

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:23.920
It's a game of tag! But it's not just a
game. If they catch you, they kill you!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.530
The guards hunt us like game!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:43.240
I told you I'd make you my little bitch...

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:52.650
Huh. So devils have taken possession
of you guys' twisted desires.

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:04.760
Huh... What pretty jewels.

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:06.870
I bet they'd be perfect
for decorating my room.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:10.740
I shall grant you a wish.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:19.170
I shall grant you a wish.

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:22.470
Well, you're definitely
not your typical devil.

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:24.890
What is the problem? Tell me what you want.

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:27.220
Okay, I might as well give it a shot.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:32.360
I'll take eternal youth, so I
can remain flawlessly beautiful.

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.570
No way.

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:39.310
How about all the jewels in the world? I'd
like to try bathing in a tub filled with them.

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:41.760
No. I'm not interested.

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.600
Well, can I at least have
a nice dress or something?

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:47.590
No. It wouldn't benefit you.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.490
You're useless. Die, then!

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.620
Listen up. You guys are criminals.

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:15.490
"Tag"? You got to be kidding me.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:17.610
I just reported this to police headquarters.

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:19.380
Wh-What?!

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:24.110
This time judgment will be passed on you.
And don't even think about trying to run away.

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:28.240
I mean, this place is famous for
being an inescapable hell, isn't it?

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.690
Idiot!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:36.860
We run this place! We know how to get out!

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.670
All right, open the gate!

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:58.830
My thanks.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:02.430
Yep, nothing like the air on the outside.

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.610
Y-You bastard!

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:18.960
I'll raise.

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:24.920
So you escaped from Devil's
Prison, huh? Impressive as always.

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:27.640
I guess... I'll raise, too.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.700
So what happened? Call.

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:32.610
It's a long story.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.570
Full house.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.490
Sorry about that.

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:40.460
Yeah, I'm sorry too... Royal straight flush.

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:45.070
Aren't you holding one too many cards?

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:47.260
Yeah, I threw in an extra as a bonus.

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:50.640
Knock it off! You know you just got busted!

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:52.650
You can die, for all I care.

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:55.540
I shall grant your wish.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:59.570
It's him! He's the one who...

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.860
Ah, what a good boy.

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:04.130
I'm surprised you'd come to
me and save me the trouble.

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:06.860
Lady, who is this dude?

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:12.090
Search me. Some generous
mask that'll grant you any wish.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.640
St-Stop!

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.000
I'm sorry.

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.200
Please stop!

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:20.420
No way.

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:23.170
I'm begging you! Spare me!

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:26.070
No. Not interested.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:33.450
Do it Dante! Kill him!

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:42.750
What's wrong? Will you spare me or not?

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:47.360
The next line is "It wouldn't
benefit you," you know that.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.290
I'll take this!

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:13.350
Wouldn't expect anything less of you, Dante.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:17.110
You really are strong...
I can't help but respect you.

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:19.930
You... What kind of scheme
are you cooking up?

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:22.760
Well, you'll find out sometime.

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:26.360
One should always save the fun part for last.

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:31.650
Just you watch, Dante...

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:41.520
So, what are you going to do now?
Nobody's going to call you a liar anymore.

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:44.960
You've been cleared of all suspicion.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:49.590
Thank you so much for
everything you've done for me.

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:54.680
But, maybe the world would
be better off if I were in prison.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.860
What do you mean by that?

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:00.580
Do you still feel responsible
for your friend's death?

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:04.040
It's not just that...

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:06.560
My younger sister's dead because of me too.

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:07.360
Younger sister?

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:11.630
Yeah. Lynn's always been frail.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:16.320
But when I got arrested, she was stricken
with worry and her condition went downhill.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.480
She must resent me.

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:24.070
Does this sister of yours
have sapphire-colored pigtails?

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:25.790
Yeah.

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:30.490
Your younger sister doesn't resent you.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:31.850
That ring...

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:34.730
I bought that for Lynn...

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:36.460
How did you come by it?

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:41.020
The person who hired me paid with
this in the place of money, saying:

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:43.880
"Please save my older brother."

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:47.590
How can... that be...?

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:49.370
See ya.

00:22:11.900 --> 00:22:15.720
I got you! Today I want
my ten ice cream cones!

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:17.310
Just one.

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:18.550
No way.

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:21.290
Well, how about another game of poker?

00:22:21.290 --> 00:22:23.760
No. I'm not interested.

00:24:02.360 --> 00:24:03.950
Everyone has a past.

00:24:04.590 --> 00:24:10.770
The problem is that people's pasts
are not always picture-perfect.

00:24:11.980 --> 00:24:14.190
When you decide to
confront your detestable past,

00:24:15.210 --> 00:24:17.170
what determines whether you'll
be able to dispel its darkness

00:24:17.620 --> 00:24:21.270
is how fruitful the time you've
spent since then has been.

00:24:22.660 --> 00:24:26.990
In other words, I shouldn't
have anything to worry about.